Language English
Debug Off

Book Chapel Ordered No Keep Looped

	Page Place
		Triggered By @ExploreChapelViaLibrary
		
		Remove TokenExploreChapelViaLibrary
		Add TileChapel, TokenChapelTrapdoor!, TokenChapelWall!
		
		Prolog """
			The door behind the bookcase is unlocked now. You aren't sure if you
			want to see what's behind the door, but curiosity is getting the 
			better of you. You look around, then reach for then door...
		"""
		Button "Explore"
		
		Text """
			You grab the handle and pull. Behind it is the opening of a dark
			tunnel. You walk in, but eventually it's so dark that you are
			feeling your way along the smooth stone walls. Eventually,
			you can see light coming through a crack in the ceiling. A
			staircase leads up to it. You find a door in the ceiling and when
			you open it, you find yourself
			in an old chapel. In the distance, through one
			of the windows, you can see the house you are supposed to be
			cleaning.

			Place the {c:TileChapel} tile, wall, and trap door as
			indicated, then discard this Explore token. Move 1 space into the
			Chapel.
		"""
		
		$mythosChapel = true
		
		exploredChapel = true
		wandererInLibrary = false
	End Page Place
	
	Page PlaceExploreOutsideViaChapelLocked
		Add TokenExploreEscapeViaChapelLocked!
	
		Text """
			Across the room in is the front door of the chapel.
			Place an Explore token as indicated.
		"""
	End Page PlaceExploreOutsideViaChapelLocked
	
	Page PlaceWhiskey
		Add TokenSearchChapelWhiskey!
		
		Text """
			The room is clean, maintained with devotion.

			Surprisingly, there's a bottle lying on one of the pews. Place a
			Search token as indicated.
		"""
	End Page PlaceWhiskey
	
	Page PlaceSearchRitualComponents
		Add TokenSearchChapelRitualComponents!
		
		Text """
			A ceremonial table sits next to you at the front of the room. There
			is a large book and various religious icons and implements. Place a
			Search token as indicated.
		"""
	
		Exit
	End Page PlaceSearchRitualComponents
	
	Page ExploreEscapeViaChapelLocked
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @ExploreEscapeViaChapelLocked
		
		Prolog """
			You pull out keys and starting trying them in the lock.
		"""
		Button "Explore"
		
		Text """
			As you work through the keys, you hesitate. Whatever is going on
			here could affect you, even if you leave immediately. You take a
			breath and turn back to face the room. Discard this Explore token.
		"""
		
		Remove TokenExploreEscapeViaChapelLocked

		Exit
	End Page ExploreEscapeViaChapelLocked
	
	Page SearchRitualComponents
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @SearchChapelRitualComponents
		
		Prolog """
			You walk over to the altar. There is a large book set out on it.
		"""
		Button "Search"
		
		Text QItemRitualComponents """
			As you walk around the altar to get a better look, you see that
			there is a chalice, some herbs, and even a skull. As you prepare to
			tuck the skull into your bag, you reflect on the many times you've
			been in these situations. You've learned to shamelessly grab
			anything you might need, no matter how unlikely. Gain the
			{c:QItemRitualComponents} Unique Item.

			The book is the Smythe family bible. The first section lists
			births, marriages, and deaths going back many generations. A few 
			of the men--all named Smythe--have a {success} next to their names.
			{c:EventChosenInvestigator}'s cousin Mathias has this marking. You
			aren't sure what it means, but from what you've seen and read today,
			it worries you.
				
			Gain 2 {clue}, then discard this Search token.
		"""

		Remove TokenSearchChapelRitualComponents
		
		foundRitualComponents = true
		Exit
	End Page SearchRitualComponents
	
	Page SearchWhiskey
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @SearchChapelWhiskey
		
		Prolog """
			There's a liquor bottle here. Someone has picked at the edges of the
			label. It's about half-full.
		"""
		Button "Search"
		
		Text QItemWhiskey """
			You bend down to pick it up and casually smell the bottle. Man,
			that is some good whiskey! Gain the {c:QItemWhiskey} Common Item,
			then discard this Search token.
		"""

		Remove TokenSearchChapelWhiskey
		
		$mythosMinor = true
		Goto SearchWhiskeyNoise
	End Page SearchWhiskey
	
	Page SearchWhiskeyNoise
		Not Visible
		Add TokenChapelPriestAlive!
		
		Text """
			While you are bent over getting the bottle, you don't notice the
			chapel door swing open and a priest walk in. Without looking around,
			he walks along the back wall and turns to walk to the front of the 
			room. 

			As you stand up, pleased with your find, you catch your shirt on the
			pew, trip, and fall to the ground. When you hit the floor, you 
			let out a loud curse.

			The priest turns, his face turning from startled to angry. <<Who are
			you and how did you get in here?>>
			
			Place the White Man token as indicated.
		"""
		
		Exit
	End Page SearchWhiskeyNoise
	
	Page TalkToPriest
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @TalkToChapelPriest
		
		Text "The priest is glaring at you expectantly. You respond, ..."
		
		Button 1, "{action} <<What are <i>you</i> doing here?!"
		Button 2, "{action} <<I'm with a cleaning service and I got lost."
		Button 3, "{action} In for a penny, in for a pound: kill him"
		Button 4, "Cancel"
		
		If selection = 4 Then Mark Unread
		If selection = 4 Then Exit
		
		If selection = 1 Then Goto ChallengePriest
		if selection = 2 Then Goto TruthToPriest
		Goto KillPriest
	End Page TalkToPriest
	
	Page ChallengePriest
		Not Visible
		No Text
		 
		Remove TokenChapelPriestAlive
		Call Event SpawnCustomMonsterChapelRiot
		Exit
	End Page ChallengePriest
	
	Page TruthToPriest
		Not Visible
		
		Text QItemRitualDagger """
			<<Oh,>> the priest brightens. <<Benjamin told me you'd be here
			today. I'm not sure how you found this place, but you should head
			back to the house and get to work. We need that place cleaned up.
			I'll remind the boys that you're here at Benjamin's request.>> The
			priest turns and walks back outside, leaving you puzzled at all
			of this.
			
			Discard the White Man token.
			
			As you ponder, you look down and see that the priest dropped
			something. Wrapped in cloth is an ornate knife. Gain the 
			{c:QItemRitualDagger} Common Item.

			<<A Haunted house, murdered kids, and now what looks like a local
			cult,>> you mutter to yourself. <<What have I gotten myself into?>>		
		"""
		
		Remove TokenChapelPriest
		
		wandererFrequency = wandererFrequency + 2

		Goto PlaceSearchCryptViaChapel
	End Page TruthToPriest
	
	Page PlaceSearchCryptViaChapel
		Not Visible
		
		Add TokenSearchCryptViaChapel!
		
		TEXT """
			As you pick up the knife, something about the floor makes you
			look twice. Place a Search token as indicated.
		"""
		
		foundRitualDagger = true
		Exit	
	End Page PlaceSearchCryptViaChapel
	
	
	Page KillPriest
		Not Visible
		
		Text QItemRitualDagger """
			You cock your arm to punch the priest and he raises his arms in
			defense. You punch hard through his waving arms and strike him in
			the temple. The man falls back, hitting his head on the corner of a
			pew. He slumps, seizes for a minute, and then goes still.
			
			You look down at the dead priest and see something 
			falling out of the his robes. Gain the {c:QItemRitualDagger}.
			
			<<A haunted house, dead kids, and now a local cult,>> you mutter to
			yourself. <<I should get out of here before someone finds this
			body.>>

			Discard the White Man token.
		"""
		
		Remove TokenChapelPriestAlive

		chapelPriestDead = 1
		wandererMax = wandererMax + 1
		If wandererMax > 6 Then WandererMax = 6
		wandererFrequency = wandererFrequency - 1
		
		Goto PlaceSearchCryptViaChapel
	End Page KillPriest
	
	Page DefeatRiot
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @DefeatedCustomMonsterChapelRiot
	
		Text QItemRitualDagger """
			The priest and his men lie dead at your feet, their blood seeping
			into the wooden floor.
			
			<<A haunted house, dead kids, and now a local cult,>> you mutter to
			yourself. <<I should get out of here before anyone else shows up.>>
			
			You casually look down at the carnage and think, <i>Maybe there's
			something in there I can use?</i>  Then you see it:  something 
			falling out of the priest's robe. Gain the {c:QItemRitualDagger}.
		"""
		
		chapelPriestDead = 1
		
		// add a wanderer and shorten the time between them
		wandererMax = wandererMax + 1
		If wandererMax > 6 Then WandererMax = 6
		wandererFrequency = wandererFrequency - 1
		
		Goto PlaceSearchCryptViaChapel
	End Page
	
	Page SearchRitualDagger
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @SearchChapelRitualDagger If Unread
		
		Prolog """
			The priest lies dead on the floor in front of you. Before you go
			digging through his robes, maybe make sure he's really dead.
		"""
		Button "Make sure he's dead"
		
		Text QItemRitualDagger """
			You step a bit closer and touch the body lightly with your foot.
			
			Nothing.
			
			With more confidence, you kick the body and it rolls limply off
			its side. As it rolls, the priest's robes fall open, revealing an
			ornate knife wrapped in cloth. Gain the {c:QItemRitualDagger}
			Common Item.
			
			<<Hey, did any of you see the priest's right hand twitch?>>
		"""
		
		Exit
	End Page SearchRitualDagger
	
	Page SearchRitualDaggerAfter
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @SearchChapelRitualDagger If SearchRitualDagger Is Read	
		
		Prolog "The priest's fingers move slightly."
		Button "Make sure he's dead"
		
		Text """
			The recently dead sometimes twitch.
			You should probably leave the priest alone and get on with it.
			
			Discard this Search token.
		"""
		
		Remove TokenChapelPriest
		Exit
	End Page SearchRitualDaggerAfter
	
	Page SearchCryptViaChapel
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @SearchCryptViaChapel
		
		Prolog """
			Something here doesn't feel right. You lean down to take a closer
			look at the wooden floor.
		"""
		Button "Search"
		
		Text """
			One of the floor boards isn't exactly the same level as the others
			around it. It also seems to be more worn. You press on it and it
			moves, but not very much.
			
			You stand up and step on it. The panel sinks in and makes a
			satisfying click. The wall in front of you pops open. Discard the 
			wall and this Search token.
		"""
		
		Remove TokenSearchCryptViaChapel
		Remove TokenChapelWall
		
		Goto SearchCryptViaChapel2
	End Page SearchCryptViaChapel
	
	Page SearchCryptViaChapel2
		Not Visible
		
		Add TileCrypt
		
		Text """
			You pull the wall back to expose a doorway with a stone door. You
			push on it. Place the {c:TileCrypt} tile.
		"""
		
		If exploredCrypt Then TEXT """
			You pull back the wall to find a doorway with a stone door. You
			push on it. Place the {c:TileCrypt} tile. <<This
			is the door we found in the crypt earlier,>> you say.
		"""
		
		If Not exploredCrypt Then Trigger @ExploreCryptViaChapel

		Exit
	End Page SearchCryptViaChapel2
End Book Chapel